### Session Status API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Check Session Status Without Login (Should be Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 2. Login to Establish Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-terminal-verify@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### 3. Check Session Status After Login (Should be Active)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 4. Refresh Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 5. Check Session Status After Refresh (Should Still be Active)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 6. Logout to End Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 7. Check Session Status After Logout (Should be Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 8. Login with Remember Me for Extended Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-terminal-verify@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### 9. Check Extended Session Status (Should be Active with Extended Expiry)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 10. Refresh Extended Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 11. Check Extended Session Status After Refresh
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 12. Logout Extended Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 13. Verify Session is Terminated After Extended Session Logout
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 14. Test Multiple Login Attempts (Session Replacement)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-terminal-verify@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### 15. Check First Session Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 16. Login Again (Should Replace Previous Session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-terminal-verify@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### 17. Check New Session Status (Should Show New Session)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### 18. Final Cleanup - Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}